    "path": "Angular/Angular-Detailed-Chunk-11-Angular14-vs-Angular22/README.md",
    "content": "# Angular Interview Guide — Chunk 11\n\n## Angular 14 vs Angular 22\n\n- [101. How Did Standalone Components Evolve from Developer Preview in Angular 14 to the Default Component Model in Angular 22?](101-standalone-components-evolution.md)\n- [102. How Did Typed Reactive Forms in Angular 14 Improve Safety, and What Does Angular 22 Add with Signal Forms?](102-typed-reactive-forms-and-signal-forms.md)\n- [103. How Do Angular 22 Signals Differ from the RxJS-Heavy State Patterns Commonly Used in Angular 14?](103-signals-vs-rxjs-state.md)\n- [104. How Do Signal Inputs, Outputs, Model Inputs, and Signal Queries Differ from Decorator APIs?](104-signal-component-apis.md)\n- [105. How Does @for Track Items, and How Does It Compare with an Angular 14 trackBy Function?](105-for-track-vs-trackby.md)\n- [106. How Does an Angular 14 NgModule Application Differ from an Angular 22 Standalone Application?](106-ngmodule-vs-standalone-app.md)\n- [107. How Does Built-in @if, @for, and @switch Control Flow Differ from Structural Directives?](107-built-in-control-flow.md)\n- [108. How Did Angular Build and Development Tooling Change from Angular 14 Webpack to the Modern Application Builder?](108-modern-build-tooling.md)\n- [109. How Have SSR, Hydration, Event Replay, and Incremental Hydration Evolved Since Angular 14?](109-ssr-hydration-evolution.md)\n- [110. How Do Testing Tools Change from Angular 14 Karma/Jasmine Projects to Vitest in Angular 22?](110-karma-jasmine-to-vitest.md)\n- [111. How Would You Replace bootstrapModule and AppModule with bootstrapApplication and Application Providers?](111-bootstrap-application-providers.md)\n- [112. What Are Deferrable Views with @defer, and What Problem Do They Solve Compared with Angular 14?](112-deferrable-views.md)\n- [113. What Are the Most Important Differences Between Angular 14 and Angular 22?](113-most-important-differences.md)\n- [114. What Is Zoneless Change Detection, and How Does It Differ from Angular 14 Zone.js Behavior?](114-zoneless-change-detection.md)\n- [115. When Should an Angular 22 Application Still Use RxJS Instead of Signals?](115-when-to-use-rxjs.md)\n\nEach question has its own detailed Markdown file. No two questions are mixed into one lesson.\n"
